15:T441,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is CIMEA the same as a Declaration of Value?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. They are different qualification-information routes. The university or competent authority decides which evidence it accepts or requires."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do all Italian universities require CIMEA?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Requirements vary by university, programme, qualification country and stage of enrolment. Read the exact current instructions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I order CIMEA before admission?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Only when the university says it is required at that stage or the processing timeline makes early action necessary. Confirm the exact service first."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a Declaration of Value guarantee recognition?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. It supplies information about a foreign qualification; the receiving institution makes the relevant academic decision."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Guides\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"CIMEA vs Declaration of Value for studying in Italy\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/cimea-vs-declaration-of-value-italy/\"}]}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"CIMEA vs Declaration of Value for studying in Italy\",\"description\":\"Understand CIMEA statements and the Declaration 